<title>ARGENTINA: Alpargatas Q1 net loss $39.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Alpargatas Q1 net loss $39.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net loss $39.4 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: textile and footware company Alpargatas Sociedad Anonima Industrial y Comercial reported no comparatives nor EPS.</p>
<p>It said its results included a $32.7 million extraordinary loss.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180-650))</p>
